{"page":391,"width":1666,"height":2334,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"장 맛있는 것부터 먹는 것과 같다. “람욕적”이라는 단어의 뉘앙스는 안 좋지만 실제로는 상당히","words":[{"text":"장","x":154,"y":182,"width":27,"height":30},{"text":"맛있는","x":192,"y":181,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"것부터","x":288,"y":181,"width":76,"height":32},{"text":"먹는","x":380,"y":181,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"것과","x":444,"y":181,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"같다.","x":505,"y":182,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"“람욕적”이라는","x":577,"y":181,"width":177,"height":32},{"text":"단어의","x":765,"y":182,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"뉘앙스는","x":853,"y":182,"width":104,"height":30},{"text":"안","x":967,"y":182,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"좋지만","x":1005,"y":181,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"실제로는","x":1097,"y":180,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"상당히","x":1214,"y":181,"width":77,"height":32}]},{"text":"좋은 알고리즘을 만들어 내는 알고리즘 설계 기법이다.","words":[{"text":"좋은","x":154,"y":234,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":219,"y":234,"width":136,"height":30},{"text":"만들어","x":365,"y":233,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"내는","x":454,"y":233,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"알고리즘","x":514,"y":233,"width":103,"height":31},{"text":"설계","x":628,"y":233,"width":48,"height":31},{"text":"기법이다.","x":689,"y":234,"width":108,"height":30}]},{"text":"가장","words":[{"text":"가장","x":491,"y":354,"width":40,"height":22}]},{"text":"맛있는것부터","words":[{"text":"맛있는것부터","x":450,"y":390,"width":119,"height":23}]},{"text":"먼저.","words":[{"text":"먼저.","x":486,"y":427,"width":43,"height":22}]},{"text":"[그림 11-3] 탐욕적인 알고리즘의 비유","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":149,"y":729,"width":53,"height":28},{"text":"11-3]","x":213,"y":727,"width":57,"height":28},{"text":"탐욕적인","x":288,"y":729,"width":85,"height":24},{"text":"알고리즘의","x":383,"y":729,"width":105,"height":25},{"text":"비유","x":498,"y":730,"width":41,"height":24}]},{"text":"탐욕적인 알고리즘에서 순간의 선택은 그 당시에는 최적이다. 하지만 최적이라고 생각했던 지","words":[{"text":"탐욕적인","x":180,"y":833,"width":110,"height":30},{"text":"알고리즘에서","x":302,"y":832,"width":161,"height":32},{"text":"순간의","x":475,"y":834,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"선택은","x":565,"y":834,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"그","x":652,"y":838,"width":26,"height":21},{"text":"당시에는","x":687,"y":834,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"최적이다.","x":803,"y":836,"width":111,"height":31},{"text":"하지만","x":928,"y":836,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"최적이라고","x":1017,"y":836,"width":133,"height":31},{"text":"생각했던","x":1159,"y":834,"width":105,"height":31},{"text":"지","x":1277,"y":834,"width":22,"height":31}]},{"text":"역적인 해답들을 모아서 최종적인 해답을 만들었다고 해서, 그 해답이 반드시 전역적으로 최적","words":[{"text":"역적인","x":150,"y":884,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"해답들을","x":243,"y":884,"width":112,"height":30},{"text":"모아서","x":366,"y":884,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"최종적인","x":461,"y":885,"width":105,"height":31},{"text":"해답을","x":579,"y":886,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"만들었다고","x":667,"y":886,"width":132,"height":31},{"text":"해서,","x":810,"y":888,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"그","x":884,"y":892,"width":27,"height":21},{"text":"해답이","x":922,"y":888,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"반드시","x":1013,"y":887,"width":76,"height":31},{"text":"전역적으로","x":1105,"y":887,"width":133,"height":30},{"text":"최적","x":1250,"y":886,"width":49,"height":30}]},{"text":"이라는 보장은 없다. 따라서 탐욕적인 방법은 항상 최적의 해답을 주는지를 검증해야 한다. 다행","words":[{"text":"이라는","x":149,"y":936,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"보장은","x":240,"y":936,"width":85,"height":30},{"text":"없다.","x":337,"y":936,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"따라서","x":410,"y":936,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"탐욕적인","x":501,"y":937,"width":105,"height":31},{"text":"방법은","x":617,"y":937,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"항상","x":703,"y":938,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"최적의","x":767,"y":939,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"해답을","x":856,"y":939,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"주는지를","x":944,"y":939,"width":107,"height":31},{"text":"검증해야","x":1061,"y":938,"width":107,"height":31},{"text":"한다.","x":1176,"y":938,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"다행","x":1249,"y":938,"width":51,"height":30}]},{"text":"히 Kruskal의 알고리즘은 최적의 해답을 주는 것으로 중명되어 있다.","words":[{"text":"히","x":148,"y":989,"width":22,"height":31},{"text":"Kruskal의","x":184,"y":988,"width":132,"height":30},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":329,"y":988,"width":137,"height":31},{"text":"최적의","x":476,"y":989,"width":76,"height":31},{"text":"해답을","x":565,"y":989,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"주는","x":651,"y":990,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"것으로","x":713,"y":989,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"중명되어","x":800,"y":991,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":917,"y":991,"width":57,"height":30}]},{"text":"Kmskal의 알고리즘은 최소 비용 신장 트리가 최소 비용의 간선으로 구성됨과 동시에 사이클","words":[{"text":"Kmskal의","x":177,"y":1040,"width":133,"height":30},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":324,"y":1040,"width":137,"height":30},{"text":"최소","x":472,"y":1041,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"비용","x":536,"y":1041,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"신장","x":598,"y":1040,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"트리가","x":658,"y":1041,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"최소","x":748,"y":1041,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"비용의","x":811,"y":1042,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"간선으로","x":898,"y":1041,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"구성됨과","x":1014,"y":1041,"width":109,"height":31},{"text":"동시에","x":1131,"y":1041,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"사이클","x":1222,"y":1041,"width":82,"height":30}]},{"text":"을 포함하지 않는다는 조건에 근거하여, 각 단계에서 사이클을 이루지 않는 최소 비용 간선을 선","words":[{"text":"을","x":146,"y":1093,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"포함하지","x":184,"y":1091,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"않는다는","x":307,"y":1091,"width":110,"height":31},{"text":"조건에","x":427,"y":1092,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"근거하여,","x":517,"y":1092,"width":112,"height":31},{"text":"각","x":641,"y":1091,"width":27,"height":30},{"text":"단계에서","x":677,"y":1091,"width":102,"height":31},{"text":"사이클을","x":791,"y":1093,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"이루지","x":908,"y":1093,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"않는","x":997,"y":1094,"width":54,"height":29},{"text":"최소","x":1060,"y":1093,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"비용","x":1124,"y":1093,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"간선을","x":1187,"y":1093,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"선","x":1278,"y":1093,"width":25,"height":28}]},{"text":"택한다. 이러한 과정을 반복함으로써 네트워크의 모든 정점을 최소 비용으로 연결하는 최적 해","words":[{"text":"택한다.","x":148,"y":1144,"width":87,"height":30},{"text":"이러한","x":253,"y":1143,"width":84,"height":30},{"text":"과정을","x":348,"y":1143,"width":83,"height":30},{"text":"반복함으로써","x":443,"y":1143,"width":156,"height":30},{"text":"네트워크의","x":614,"y":1143,"width":127,"height":31},{"text":"모든","x":754,"y":1146,"width":54,"height":27},{"text":"정점을","x":820,"y":1144,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"최소","x":909,"y":1144,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"비용으로","x":975,"y":1145,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"연결하는","x":1094,"y":1144,"width":106,"height":30},{"text":"최적","x":1212,"y":1144,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"해","x":1278,"y":1144,"width":24,"height":29}]},{"text":"답을 구할 수 있다. Kruskal의 알고리즘은 먼저 그래프의 간선들을 가중치의 오름차순으로 정렬","words":[{"text":"답을","x":147,"y":1195,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"구할","x":210,"y":1195,"width":58,"height":29},{"text":"수","x":276,"y":1194,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":317,"y":1194,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"Kruskal의","x":390,"y":1194,"width":128,"height":30},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":531,"y":1194,"width":131,"height":29},{"text":"먼저","x":672,"y":1193,"width":48,"height":31},{"text":"그래프의","x":732,"y":1195,"width":102,"height":30},{"text":"간선들을","x":846,"y":1195,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"가중치의","x":962,"y":1196,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"오름차순으로","x":1080,"y":1196,"width":161,"height":29},{"text":"정렬","x":1252,"y":1195,"width":51,"height":29}]},{"text":"한다. 정릴된 간선들의 리스트에서 사이클을 형성하지 않는 간선을 찾아서 현재의 최소 비용 신","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":146,"y":1246,"width":61,"height":30},{"text":"정릴된","x":224,"y":1245,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"간선들의","x":317,"y":1245,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"리스트에서","x":440,"y":1245,"width":128,"height":29},{"text":"사이클을","x":581,"y":1244,"width":106,"height":30},{"text":"형성하지","x":697,"y":1245,"width":102,"height":30},{"text":"않는","x":813,"y":1246,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"간선을","x":875,"y":1247,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"찾아서","x":965,"y":1247,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"현재의","x":1058,"y":1247,"width":76,"height":29},{"text":"최소","x":1148,"y":1247,"width":54,"height":29},{"text":"비용","x":1214,"y":1246,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"신","x":1278,"y":1247,"width":26,"height":29}]},{"text":"장 트리의 집합에 추가한다. 만약 사이클을 형성하면 그 간선은 제외된다. 최소 비용 신장 트리","words":[{"text":"장","x":146,"y":1298,"width":28,"height":30},{"text":"트리의","x":184,"y":1297,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"집합에","x":281,"y":1296,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"추가한다.","x":373,"y":1296,"width":115,"height":30},{"text":"만약","x":504,"y":1295,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"사이클을","x":568,"y":1295,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"형성하면","x":684,"y":1295,"width":104,"height":31},{"text":"그","x":799,"y":1301,"width":27,"height":20},{"text":"간선은","x":836,"y":1297,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"제외된다.","x":927,"y":1298,"width":113,"height":30},{"text":"최소","x":1056,"y":1298,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"비용","x":1121,"y":1298,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"신장","x":1185,"y":1297,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"트리","x":1250,"y":1298,"width":52,"height":30}]},{"text":"를 구하는 Kruskal의 알고리즘은 알고리즘 11.2와 같이 요약된다.","words":[{"text":"를","x":145,"y":1352,"width":29,"height":28},{"text":"구하는","x":182,"y":1349,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"Kruskal의","x":276,"y":1347,"width":130,"height":29},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":419,"y":1346,"width":134,"height":30},{"text":"알고리즘","x":562,"y":1346,"width":104,"height":30},{"text":"11.2와","x":676,"y":1347,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"같이","x":757,"y":1347,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"요약된다.","x":819,"y":1348,"width":112,"height":31}]},{"text":"알고리즘 11.2 Kruskal의 최소 비용 신장 트리 알고리즘","words":[{"text":"알고리즘","x":198,"y":1485,"width":90,"height":25},{"text":"11.2","x":296,"y":1485,"width":42,"height"